#ASSERT `chapter 29, first sentence: what is done to a Freeman` TRUE `any other wise destroyed` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `not forbidden by chapter 29`
#ASSERT `chapter 29, first sentence: what is done to a Freeman` TRUE `any other wise destroyed` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `not forbidden by chapter 29`
